#: 4609b4685f824f22ac2b8de2d6a69501
msgid "The RCIN pin is mapped to a timer input instead of the UART, and can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, can provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-yjuav-a6ultra.rst:439
#: ef4244b4c7b442408b7e625172c3a595
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, a full UART must be used. For example, UART1 can have its protocol changed from the default GPS protocol for GPS2 to RX input protocol:"
